       scheduled AFTER the NPC build by ruling. ExcludeFromDynamicEncounters: wish-door only. -->
  <object Name="Cleo_TerraFirma_Stonecarver" Inherits="BaseHumanoid">
    <!-- COLORS, corrected 2026-08-15 after the user saw a pack render entirely grey. Cause: the
         first pass set ColorString "&y" (Colors.xml: GRAY) with DetailColor "K" (DARK GRAY), i.e.
         grey twice. The deeper fact, measured off the png: stonecarver.png is 66 black pixels to
         28 white, so roughly 70% of the sprite draws in the DETAIL channel. DetailColor is the
         body mass on this art, not an accent. Base body now reads brown-with-white, deliberately
         far from grey; still a PLACEHOLDER, and the real call is the user's now that the channel
         split is known. -->
    <part Name="Render" DisplayName="stonecarver" Tile="stonecarver.png" ColorString="&amp;Y" DetailColor="w" />
    <part Name="Description" Short="Chalk dust has worked so far into the creases of =pronouns.possessive= hands that the lines read like a map of somewhere quarried." /> <!-- DRAFT, and deliberately identity-neutral: the professions carry who these people are, and they are not built yet -->
    <stat Name="Level" Value="10" /> <!-- CLAUDE PLACEHOLDER, numbers sitting owed -->
    <tag Name="ExcludeFromDynamicEncounters" Value="*noinherit" />
